# Static Linux — Sabor: Virtual Machines
# KVM/QEMU with virt-manager and GNOME Boxes. libvirt is socket-activated and
# the user is added to the libvirt group by the installer. VirtualBox is left
# out on purpose (out-of-tree module, slower than KVM) — it's in the catalog.
# Verified against the official repos 2026-10-23.
qemu-desktop
libvirt
virt-manager
gnome-boxes
dnsmasq
edk2-ovmf
swtpm
